        "description": "Evidence of cardiac amyloidosis by imaging or biopsy",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of Val30Met TTR mutation plus clinical evidence of polyneuropathy and amyloid deposits on biopsy",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential; biopsy may be from nerve, fat pad, or other affected tissue."
  },
